From d711340224b0133f95796fbc053f58f0d8614d92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:13:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] base: reduce unnecessary debug and log spam

Disable several verbose debug/log paths across framework and
SystemUI components.

This reduces noisy logcat output from harmless or high-frequency
paths, including resource lookups, pointer icon bounds checks,
ringtone picker/debug paths, Bluetooth utility logging, dead zone
gesture logging, backup confirmation debugging, missing provider
lookups, unavailable light requests, and scrim trace counters.

Also lower the alarm count mismatch log level from wtf to warning
to avoid over-reporting a recoverable condition.

Signed-off-by: Yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
Signed-off-by: yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
